{"id":"n76541-1-11","stage":5,"title":"정서 · 情绪","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n76541-1-11-1","ko":"태교에는 무엇이 좋을까요?","zh":"做胎教的话，什么比较好呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"태교에는","meaning":"胎教","explanation":"태교：胎教；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"태교","audio":"/audio/56714eab16b3a0de3026.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82779","senseId":"1","lemma":"태교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"태교에는","audio":"/audio/193d0043758cc0605559.mp3"}},{"text":"무엇이","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무엇：什么；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"무엇","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17199","senseId":"2","lemma":"무엇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무엇이","audio":"/audio/4f4c7be9c457a9adbf72.mp3"}},{"text":"좋을까요?","meaning":"好，有益，有效","explanation":"좋다：好，有益，有效；을까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"14","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋을까요","audio":"/audio/4799ead06e7db95648e5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"56714eab16b3a0de","term":"태교","zh":"胎教","audio":"/audio/56714eab16b3a0de3026.mp3","entryId":"82779","definition":"孕妇为给胎儿带来良好影响，端正心态、谨言慎行。","pronunciation":["태교"]},{"id":"c95167f3fe21887b","term":"무엇","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3","entryId":"17199","definition":"指代不确定或不需要明指的对象。","pronunciation":["무얻"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，有益，有效","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"具有使身体或健康变得更好的性质。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/9bd62a19d943caec01f2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n76541-1-11-2","ko":"음악 감상을 해 보세요. 아이의 정서 순화에 도움이 됩니다.","zh":"可以试试听音乐，这有助于调节宝宝的情绪。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"음악","meaning":"音乐","explanation":"음악：音乐","readings":[{"term":"음악","audio":"/audio/88caa317d96897c98d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71115","senseId":"1","lemma":"음악","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음악","audio":"/audio/88caa317d96897c98d10.mp3"}},{"text":"감상을","meaning":"欣赏，鉴赏","explanation":"감상：欣赏，鉴赏；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"감상","audio":"/audio/a78614f4b875ba47d020.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85862","senseId":"1","lemma":"감상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"감상을","audio":"/audio/9e123ef594d2a9fc840b.mp3"}},{"text":"해","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}},{"text":"보세요.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보세요","audio":"/audio/10b2f8c9f190884edd75.mp3"}},{"text":"아이의","meaning":"婴儿，孩子","explanation":"아이：婴儿，孩子；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"3","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이의","audio":"/audio/1fbb843c67be8ce34ca7.mp3"}},{"text":"정서","meaning":"情绪","explanation":"정서：情绪","readings":[{"term":"정서","audio":"/audio/8144c32ff9e78faf0409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"76541","senseId":"1","lemma":"정서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정서","audio":"/audio/8144c32ff9e78faf0409.mp3"}},{"text":"순화에","meaning":"感化，教化","explanation":"순화：感化，教化；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"순화","audio":"/audio/e872d3773db3c6119fe2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65144","senseId":"1","lemma":"순화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"순화에","audio":"/audio/bfbdb190c365b6254b7b.mp3"}},{"text":"도움이","meaning":"帮助，帮忙，援助","explanation":"도움：帮助，帮忙，援助；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"도움","audio":"/audio/8d901cc28dffe7ee0af6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64542","senseId":"1","lemma":"도움","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도움이","audio":"/audio/3b08bc5e3edb39bddbce.mp3"}},{"text":"됩니다.","meaning":"变得，弄得","explanation":"되다：变得，弄得；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"됩니다","audio":"/audio/d5bd67992682ed3f7e8d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"88caa317d96897c9","term":"음악","zh":"音乐","audio":"/audio/88caa317d96897c98d10.mp3","entryId":"71115","definition":"用嗓音或乐器按照拍子和节奏发出声音，表达想法或感情的艺术。","pronunciation":["으막"]},{"id":"a78614f4b875ba47","term":"감상","zh":"欣赏，鉴赏","audio":"/audio/a78614f4b875ba47d020.mp3","entryId":"85862","definition":"对艺术作品或景色享受和理解，同时做出评价。","pronunciation":["감상"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"婴儿，孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"尚未出生或刚刚出生的幼儿。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"8144c32ff9e78faf","term":"정서","zh":"情绪","audio":"/audio/8144c32ff9e78faf0409.mp3","entryId":"76541","definition":"喜悦、悲伤、爱、讨厌等人内心产生的各种感情。","pronunciation":["정서"]},{"id":"e872d3773db3c611","term":"순화","zh":"感化，教化","audio":"/audio/e872d3773db3c6119fe2.mp3","entryId":"65144","definition":"教诲人使其想法或感情变正直。","pronunciation":["순화"]},{"id":"8d901cc28dffe7ee","